<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" class="ce-bg" style="background-color:#F8FAFC;"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 16px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:560px;">
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><p class="ce-text" style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#111827;">Cohory</p></td></tr>
<tr><td class="ce-card" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
<p class="ce-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#111827;">Hi Ada,</p>
<p class="ce-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#111827;">Someone signed in to your Cohory account asked to move it to ada.new@example.com. Approve the change from this address first. We then ask ada.new@example.com to confirm itself.</p>
<p style="margin:8px 0 24px;"><a href="https://community.example.com/verify?t=1" class="ce-button-default" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#2563EB;color:#FFFFFF;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:8px;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;">Approve the change</a></p>
<p class="ce-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#111827;">The link works for 1 hour. If this was not you, do not open the link, and secure your account with a new password: https://community.example.com/forgot-password</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:16px 8px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><p class="ce-muted" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#64748B;">Sent by <a href="https://community.example.com" class="ce-link" style="color:#2563EB;">Cohory</a>. <a href="https://community.example.com/privacy" class="ce-link" style="color:#2563EB;">Privacy</a></p></td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr></table>
</body>
</html>",
  "subject": "Approve your new Cohory email address",
  "template": "change-email-confirmation",
  "text": "Hi Ada,

Someone signed in to your Cohory account asked to move it to ada.new@example.com. Approve the change from this address first. We then ask ada.new@example.com to confirm itself.

Approve the change: https://community.example.com/verify?t=1

The link works for 1 hour. If this was not you, do not open the link, and secure your account with a new password: https://community.example.com/forgot-password

Sent by Cohory.

Privacy: https://community.example.com/privacy",
}
`;

